{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.poster.avif?t=1757667023\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.webm?t=1757667023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.mp4?t=1757667023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a flower shop, design bouquets... while solving mystery of the flower shop?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puni the Florist</strong> is a cozy flower shop simulation game where you play as &quot;Puni,&quot; a florist by chance trying to start fresh. Run a flower shop, design bouquets, and solve the mystery about her shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill townsfolk\u2019s requests with your own floral designs using unique combinations of flowers and decorations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wholesome Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a silly, light-hearted, and relatable tale of self-discovery of Puni.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Floriography</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete flower collections and uncover the language of flowers through your scrapbook.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your shop your own with cute, customizable decor and personal touches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the Townsfolks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a quirky cast of characters, uncover their stories, and form lasting friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396290?t=1757667023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/c3dcce7eca2fec19f11df6f22b19c6403aab8219/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757667023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/011ada805537a20ecc8bbe4654a01a76c857fa5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757667023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/011ada805537a20ecc8bbe4654a01a76c857fa5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757667023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.poster.avif?t=1757667023\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.webm?t=1757667023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.mp4?t=1757667023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a flower shop, design bouquets... while solving mystery of the flower shop?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puni the Florist</strong> is a cozy flower shop simulation game where you play as &quot;Puni,&quot; a florist by chance trying to start fresh. Run a flower shop, design bouquets, and solve the mystery about her shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill townsfolk\u2